&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your wellbeing, our mission. Join a company shaping a healthier world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GET TO KNOW US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wellhub we&#39;re revolutionizing workplace wellness. Our platform connects employees worldwide to the best partners for fitness, mindfulness, therapy, nutrition, and sleep—all in one simple subscription. Headquartered in NYC with team members in Europe, North America and South America, we’re on a mission to make every company a wellness company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe work should be fulfilling, inspiring, and balanced. Here, you’ll find a team that values wellbeing, collaboration, and different perspectives, where passion and creativity push boundaries to create real impact. Your contributions will help shape a healthier, more balanced world for you and millions of people globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager of Social Media who will own the shaping and execution of our UK social media strategy and lead social media managers across all European markets where Wellhub operates. As the most senior Social Media professional in Europe, you&#39;ll be the regional lead for the team and the primary social media partner for senior stakeholders.In this role, you&#39;ll partner closely with our Senior Director of Global Social Media to bring the UK strategy to life—creating platform-specific content, developing cultural relevance, supporting local influencer and ambassador programs, and elevating Wellhub&#39;s presence across key platforms like Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, YouTube, and emerging channels.You&#39;re someone who lives and breathes social. You understand UK culture deeply. You know how to move fast, test fearlessly, and capture moments in real time. You have a video-first mindset and love being behind—and occasionally in front of—the camera.You&#39;ll combine hands-on UK ownership with European team management, stakeholder leadership, and accountability for regional alignment and performance. Your creativity, agility, and understanding of UK social trends will shape how consumers, partners, and companies experience Wellhub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and Execute the UK Social Media Strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape, localize, and operationalize Wellhub&#39;s social media strategy for the UK market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build regionally relevant content plans tailored for B2C, B2B, and B2P audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Wellhub&#39;s GEO efforts through content strategy, partnering with relevant teams and European social media managers to align content priorities and strengthen brand authority and discoverability across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the editorial calendar for the UK and ensure seamless alignment with global priorities, launches, campaigns, and cultural moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Social Media Managers Across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and develop social media managers across all European markets where Wellhub operates, setting clear objectives, supporting professional growth, and enabling local ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set regional priorities with the Senior Director of Global Social Media, align local plans with global strategy, and establish regular planning and performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights and successful formats across countries, resolve competing priorities, and represent the European social team in global discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create High Impact Video First Content Concept, script, shoot, and edit content optimized for Reels, TikTok, YouTube Shorts, and LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture spontaneous, social-worthy moments at local events, content shoots, and partner activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with creative and production colleagues to bring fresh ideas to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Cultural Relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify UK cultural trends, memes, humor, and moments that Wellhub can authentically participate in.Adapt global narratives to fit the UK social landscape and audience expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor competitor activity and industry trends to keep Wellhub culturally and creatively ahead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Local Ambassador and Influencer Execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of influencer and ambassador programs in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with creators and wellness influencers who authentically represent the Wellhub brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage briefings, content feedback, deliverables, and performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Stakeholder Relationships Across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the most senior Social Media representative in Europe and the primary partner for regional leadership, country leaders, and senior marketing, sales, people, PR, and partner stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alignment on social strategy, priorities, and expectations across European markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide decisions, constructively challenge requests, and resolve escalations while protecting local relevance and global brand consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with UK marketing, sales, people, PR, and partner teams to amplify locally relevant moments.Work closely with the global creative team to align content quality, storytelling, sonic identity, and brand voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support country leaders and internal spokespeople with social content, thought leadership, and engagement guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Measurement Optimisation and Insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on performance metrics across awareness, engagement, growth, and sentiment.Test new formats, creative variations, and posting strategies to continuously improve results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct social listening to understand audience behavior and guide content direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review performance across European markets with local social managers and turn shared learnings into regional recommendations and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Community Engagement and Brand Advocacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee proactive community management across the UK channels—engaging in conversations, responding to comments, and cultivating brand advocates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with global crisis and response protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience in social media, content creation, or digital marketing—ideally in fast-moving B2C or lifestyle brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re fluent in UK social culture, humor, trends, and how different audiences behave online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent English writing and editorial skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a video-first creator who is comfortable planning, shooting, editing—and occasionally stepping in front of the camera.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re obsessed with social platforms: their algorithms, nuances, and emerging formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how to speak to diverse audiences—consumers, HR leaders, corporate buyers, wellness partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly creative, but also organized and able to manage calendars, workflows, approvals, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing and developing social media teams across markets, with the judgement and autonomy to serve as the senior regional lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can influence senior stakeholders, explain your recommendations, manage difficult conversations, and align regional priorities with local needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel in ambiguous, fast-paced environments and aren&#39;t afraid to test new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a collaborative team player who values feedback, teamwork, and cross-functional partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re proactive, curious, and passionate about wellbeing and digital storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize that individuals approach job applications differently. We strongly encourage all aspiring applicants to go for it, even if they don&#39;t match the job description 100%. We welcome your application and will be delighted to explore if you could be a great fit for our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With thoughtful benefits, emotional wellbeing resources, and a culture that empowers you to take ownership of your role and your wellbeing, we create an environment where you can thrive in all dimensions of your life. Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WELLHUB:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Free Gold membership with access to onsite gyms and studios, digital fitness programs, and online wellness resources for meditation, nutrition, mental wellbeing support, and more! Add up to three family members to your plan, ensuring access to wellness for those who matter most to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HEALTHCARE:&lt;/strong&gt; Health and dental insurance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE SCHEDULE: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flexibility for us isn’t just about where we work—it also means being able to shape how and when we get things done. Together with their leaders, employees define schedules that align with their time zones, team needs, and personal routines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PAID TIME OFF:&lt;/strong&gt; We know how important it is to take time away from work to recharge. Employees receive a minimum of 25 days paid holiday per year with an additional day for each year of tenure (up to 5) in addition to annual holidays (including an extra holiday on your birthday!).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PARENTAL LEAVE:&lt;/strong&gt; Welcoming a new child is one of the most special moments in your life. Take the time to be present and enjoy your growing family. We offer 100% paid parental leave to all new parents. Parents giving birth are eligible for an extended leave and a ramp-back period to return part-time while they get settled.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAREER GROWTH:&lt;/strong&gt; Access world-class platforms, participate in interactive sessions,&amp;nbsp; build your personalized development roadmap, and explore internal opportunities. We focus on continuous learning and feedback to support your journey toward personal and professional success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CULTURE:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll join a team of passionate people who come together to break boundaries, support each other, and create a meaningful impact in workplace wellness. We win together, building trust through open communication and a culture where every perspective matters. &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/our-values/&quot;&gt;Learn more about our shared culture and values here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to see what it’s really like to work here? Follow us on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatwellhub/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instagram&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; @lifeatwellhub and watch our team video on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZgIPiszTVm4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Belonging at Wellhub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a collaborative, supportive, and inclusive space where everyone knows they belong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wellhub is committed to creating a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status, or any other basis covered by appropriate law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion also extends to how we recognize and reward our people. We’re proud to be Syndio Fair Pay Certified, reflecting our ongoing dedication to equitable and fair pay practices across our global team. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/posts/wellhub_fairpay-syndio-activity-7407826561531363328-wbN_?utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;amp;rcm=ACoAAAzHQWABKsRqcpvxy4QpDCJNe_szRdC4hgY&quot;&gt;Read more about it here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questions on how we treat your personal data? See our &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/job-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Marketing Data Analyst&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: Weybridge, Surrey, United Kingdom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, Inside Ideas Group is a rapidly growing global agency network that helps clients drive their businesses forward from the inside. We partner with over 300 clients in more than 40 countries, delivering ideas, technology and creativity that make a measurable impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of The&amp;nbsp;Brandtech&amp;nbsp;Group, we are pioneers in using advanced AI technologies to transform the way we create,&amp;nbsp;optimise&amp;nbsp;and deliver work. Our AI capabilities enhance efficiency, support smart decision making and unlock new levels of creativity for our teams and clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are now looking for a skilled Data Analyst to join our onsite team supporting in London.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As the Data Analyst, you will be responsible for delivering insight that drives improvements across the full commercial ecosystem spanning customer experience on, retailer investment effectiveness, marketing and sales performance, and the broader post-purchase, onboarding and promotional landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A core part of your remit will be the design, build and ongoing management of a marketing and sales performance dashboard, underpinned by Google BigQuery and delivered in Looker Studio. This will serve as a critical decision-making tool for marketing, e-commerce, retail and CX teams surfacing insight such as campaign uplift, halo effects, retailer investment impact and share performance across products and markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Alongside this, you will analyse customer journeys, benchmark competitors, oversee content performance and support the planning and execution of onboarding and e-commerce promotions using platforms like GWI to create digital personas and audience profiles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will collaborate closely with CX, marketing, product and e-commerce teams as well as HQ and local market stakeholders to ensure insight informs decisions at every stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role requires strong analytical capability,&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in data modelling and SQL, and the ability to translate complex commercial questions into dashboard logic and actionable recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Sales Performance Analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;a marketing and sales performance dashboard in Looker Studio, underpinned by&amp;nbsp;BigQuery, combining sell-out sales data, market volume and share data, and campaign activity logs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define the underlying data model, transform source&amp;nbsp;files&amp;nbsp;and design the reporting layer to support consistent, scalable KPI delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;and quantify the impact of retailer investment, including uplift in sales and market share during campaign periods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Analyse correlations between campaign activity and commercial performance to&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;which marketing levers are most effective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
